splaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.8em 0.8em 0.8em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>X</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mtext>std</mtext></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>where</mtext></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>U</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mtable columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mn>0.155</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.805</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.027</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.027</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.572</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.358</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.242</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.758</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.142</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.467</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.675</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.055</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.551</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.438</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.214</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0.396</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.030</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.144</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.887</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.184</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0.485</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.538</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.317</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.019</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.612</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mtable columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2.635</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2.034</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.940</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>V</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mtable columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mn>0.279</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.899</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.337</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0.716</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.039</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.697</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0.640</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.435</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.633</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>We compute the cumulative variance preserved for different numbers of components.</p>\n<p>The variance along a principal component is equal to the corresponding eigenvalue of the covariance matrix, which is proportional to the square of the corresponding singular value of the data matrix.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>The fraction of variance preserved by projecting the data onto the first principal component is \n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"485\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-msup><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.393em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><m